      "writtenOn": "2022-05-31T14:29:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Idea, not necessarily for this CL at all.\n- First thought: maybe we should have an `MakeUnsizedArrayType` function so we don\u0027t need the comment about setting `column`.\n- Second thought: maybe the unsized array Type should actually BE its own class? `SizedArrayType` and `UnsizedArrayType` could coexist as Types. `isArray` could return true for both types. I don\u0027t know if this would actually make things easier or not, but it seems like we have a lot of places where we treat them differently and they might be happier if we actually encoded this info in the type system.\n\nI haven\u0027t thought it through to the end-state but it might be worth a thought. Unsized arrays were a pain point before but maybe that was because they were just a special case on top of sized arrays.",
